※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4908 LANG_CLAUSE_ANSWER_OUTSIDE_POST

※ What the function answered is a thing there is only after it has answered.
※ A `pre` is checked before the body has run, so there is nothing yet for the
※ name to stand for.

fn step(a: u8) → u8 pre(⎕answer > a):
    a

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    ⎕narrow(step(1u8), ⌜u6⌝) ?? 1u6
